{
  "version": 8,
  "name": "Water by subtype",
  "metadata": {
    "description": "The Mississippi in deep blue, park lakes and ponds lighter, streams and canals teal \u2014 and the city's 374 swimming pools in purple. Lines (streams, drains) draw as lines, everything else as polygons."
